{"name":"Castle Tethyr","status":"ok","title":"Castle Tethyr","pageId":150640,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-building\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Castle Tethyr</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Basic Information<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p75_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p75-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tethyruins</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins<br><small><b>Formerly:</b></small> Castle</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"># of floors</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardshyr\" title=\"Bardshyr\">Bardshyr</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Marches\" title=\"Purple Marches\">Purple Marches</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tethyr\" title=\"Tethyr\">Tethyr</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"destroyed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Destroyed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eleint_12\" title=\"Eleint 12\">Eleint 12</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/1347_DR\" title=\"1347 DR\">1347 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Castle Tethyr</b> was once the palace of the royalty of <a href=\"/wiki/Tethyr\" title=\"Tethyr\">Tethyr</a> before its fall<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> at the start of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ten_Black_Days_of_Eleint\" title=\"Ten Black Days of Eleint\">Ten Black Days of Eleint</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1347_DR\" title=\"1347 DR\">Year of the Bright Blade, 1347 DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In its day, it was the largest castle in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lands_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Lands of Intrigue\">Lands of Intrigue</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> After it was burned to the ground, its haunted ruins were known as the <b>Tethyruins</b>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p75_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p75-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"toclimit-3\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Location\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Location</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Structure\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Structure</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Defenses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Defenses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Inhabitants\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Inhabitants</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Rumors_&_Legends\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Novels\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Novels</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location\">Location</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Location\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Location\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The castle was located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Purple_Marches\" title=\"Purple Marches\">Purple Marches</a>, in what would later be <a href=\"/wiki/County_Bardshyr\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"County Bardshyr\">County Bardshyr</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p75_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p75-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> It sat less than 1 mile  (1.6 kilometers) from the intersection of the <a href=\"/wiki/Trade_Way\" title=\"Trade Way\">Trade Way</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Ithal_Road\" title=\"Ithal Road\">Ithal Road</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The region around the castle was fertile for keeping herds of livestock.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The nearest town was named <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tethammar (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGV0aGFtbWFyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tethammar</span>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p47_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p47-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Structure\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Structure\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The entire square castle covered an area of about 4.6 acres  (19,000 square meters) with about 450 feet  (140 meters) per side. It had three stories and had a subterranean <a href=\"/wiki/Dungeon\" title=\"Dungeon\">dungeon</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Around the building sat many supporting structures for housing servants, soldiers, and animals; for storing food and supplies; and acting as workshops for craftsmen.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Defenses\">Defenses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Defenses\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Defenses\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The castle's walls were 45 feet  (14 meters) high. It was encompassed by a deep moat.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inhabitants\">Inhabitants</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Inhabitants\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The castle was once home to the entire royal family of Tethyr.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>After its fall, hordes of <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> infested the ruins, including <a href=\"/wiki/Ghast\" title=\"Ghast\">ghasts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">ghosts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Haunt\" title=\"Haunt\">haunts</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">shadows</a>—all the <a href=\"/wiki/Spirit\" title=\"Spirit\">spirits</a> of those who died in the betrayal that happened when the castle was burned to the ground.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n\n<p>On the night of <a href=\"/wiki/Eleint_11\" title=\"Eleint 11\">Eleint 11</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1347_DR\" title=\"1347 DR\">Year of the Bright Blade, 1347 DR</a>, a party was held to which the count of <a href=\"/wiki/Lathmarch\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lathmarch\">Lathmarch</a>, the count of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mir_Protectorate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mir Protectorate\">Mir Protectorate</a>, and the duke of <span class=\"new\" title=\"Dusk (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRHVzaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Dusk</span> had been invited.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>During the night, the castle was besieged by King <a href=\"/wiki/Alemander_IV\" title=\"Alemander IV\">Alemander IV</a>'s largest army, led by General <span class=\"new\" title=\"Nashram Sharboneth (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTmFzaHJhbV9TaGFyYm9uZXRoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Nashram Sharboneth</span>. The army also had recruited angry peasants from the surrounding countryside. These peasants soon set the castle ablaze, near midnight.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The entire castle burned to the ground over the next seven hours. By dawn of the <a href=\"/wiki/Eleint_12\" title=\"Eleint 12\">12<sup>th</sup></a>, the entire royal family, including the king and his wife, Queen <span class=\"new\" title=\"Rhinda (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUmhpbmRhP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Rhinda</span>; the king's son, Prince <a href=\"/wiki/Alemander_V\" title=\"Alemander V\">Alemander V</a>; Alemander V's wife <span class=\"new\" title=\"Dhara (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGhhcmE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Dhara</span>; and the two royal grandchildren Princes <span class=\"new\" title=\"Jhodak (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSmhvZGFrP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Jhodak</span> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Leodom (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGVvZG9tP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Leodom</span>. The noble counts and duke who had attended the party that night had also died, being prevented from being rescued by the servants by the soldiers who besieged the castle. The king's garrison commander and many of his loyal army officers also perished, because they had been strangely recalled to the inner areas of the castle rather than posted on the outer walls. General Sharboneth is supposed to have also died in the fire, though his body was never found.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>One of the few survivors of the blaze was <a href=\"/wiki/Marilyn_Haresdown\" title=\"Marilyn Haresdown\">Marilyn Haresdown</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p73_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p73-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> an officer in the army. Sadly, her husband and fellow soldier <span class=\"new\" title=\"Dorian Haresdown (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRG9yaWFuX0hhcmVzZG93bj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Dorian Haresdown</span> died in the carnage.<sup id=\"cite_ref-HoH-p123_6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HoH-p123-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> (Marilyn would later become a member of the <a href=\"/wiki/Company_of_Eight\" title=\"Company of Eight\">Company of Eight</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-HoH-p123_6-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HoH-p123-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> and after a duchess of Tethyr.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p73_5-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p73-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>) \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Rumors_.26_Legends\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rumors_&_Legends\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Several of the surviving servants of the tragedy claimed that the incident was the result of the scheming of Prince Alemander V, who plotted with General Sharboneth to take over the throne by force. However, General Sharboneth betrayed the prince in the end.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p36_2-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p36-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>On the night of the castle's fall, a <a href=\"/wiki/Priest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Priest\">priestess</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Beshaba\" title=\"Beshaba\">Beshaba</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dlatha_Faenar\" title=\"Dlatha Faenar\">Dlatha Faenar</a>, was seen visiting General Sharboneth's camp, and she was later spotted on the castle's walls as well, leading some to suspect that the <a href=\"/wiki/Church_of_Beshaba\" title=\"Church of Beshaba\">Church of Beshaba</a> also played a role in the castle's demise.<sup id=\"cite_ref-LoI1-T-p37_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-LoI1-T-p37-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>An elder <a href=\"/wiki/Beholder\" title=\"Beholder\">beholder</a> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Xithallowthlan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvWGl0aGFsbG93dGhsYW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Xithallowthlan</span> claimed to have orchestrated the events of the castle's destruction and later to have secretly aided <a href=\"/wiki/Zaranda_Star\" title=\"Zaranda Star\">Zaranda Star</a> in her rise to the throne at the end of the <a href=\"/wiki/Tethyrian_Interregnum\" title=\"Tethyrian Interregnum\">Interregum</a>—all as part of the game of <a href=\"/wiki/Vellurith\" title=\"Vellurith\">Vellurith</a>. The <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Mother\" title=\"Great Mother\">Great Mother</a> supposedly gifted Xithallowthlan with body plates covered with functional eyes as a reward for his completion of one of the goals of the game.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FtR-TV1_8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FtR-TV1-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The ghosts of Prince Alemander V and General Sharboneth were said to be in perpetual conflict with each other within the Tethyruins.<sup id=\"cite_ref-EotS-p42_1-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-EotS-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=7\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: See Also\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=8\" aria-label=\"Edit section: See Also\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Alisande Court (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWxpc2FuZGVfQ291cnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Alisande Court</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Faerntarn\" title=\"Faerntarn\">Faerntarn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shoon_Palace\" title=\"Shoon Palace\">Shoon Palace</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Thellaqar House (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlbGxhcWFyX0hvdXNlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Thellaqar House</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=9\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Novels\">Novels</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Novels\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Castle_Tethyr?veaction=edit&section=10\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Novels\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><b><small>Referenced only</small></b> <i><a href=\"/wiki/War_in_Tethyr\" title=\"War in Tethyr\">War in Tethyr</a></i></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-sectio